 ", la dette grimpe à {a} %.": ", debt climbs to {a}%.",
 ", la dette reflue à {a} %.": ", debt falls back to {a}%.",
 "Côté société, la cohésion se renforce": "In society, cohesion is getting stronger",
 "Côté société, les tensions montent": "In society, tensions are rising",
 "Le climat social est stable": "The social climate is stable",
